msgstr "``security_incidents``"

#: ../../operations.rst:534
msgid ""
"One bounded event record with its 64-component embedding (256 bytes), "
"keyed by ``node_id << 40 | sequence``."
msgstr ""
"سجل حدث محدود واحد مع تضمينه ذي 64 مكونًا (256 بايت)، مفتاحه ``node_id << "
"40 | sequence``."

#: ../../operations.rst:535
