msgstr "``incidents_fts``"

#: ../../operations.rst:536
msgid ""
"On SQLite: an FTS5 table over the canonical tokens of paths and payloads. "
"On PostgreSQL the same tokens are the ``tsvector`` column ``search`` of "
"``security_incidents`` with a GIN index."
msgstr ""
