msgstr "Linux x86-64، ARM64"

#: ../../operations.rst:627
msgid ""
"``sibuna-linux-amd64.tar.gz`` and ``sibuna-linux-arm64.tar.gz`` hold a "
"static musl executable that runs on any distribution. "
"``sibuna_<version>-1_amd64.deb``, ``sibuna_<version>-1_arm64.deb``, "
"``sibuna-<version>-1.x86_64.rpm`` and ``sibuna-<version>-1.aarch64.rpm`` "
"install it with a systemd service; "
"``sibuna-bin-<version>-1-x86_64.pkg.tar.zst`` does so on Arch Linux."
msgstr ""
"يحمل ``sibuna-linux-amd64.tar.gz`` و\\ ``sibuna-linux-arm64.tar.gz`` ملفًا "
"تنفيذيًا ثابت الربط مع musl يعمل على أي توزيعة. وتثبّته "
"``sibuna_<version>-1_amd64.deb`` و\\ ``sibuna_<version>-1_arm64.deb`` و\\ "
"``sibuna-<version>-1.x86_64.rpm`` و\\ ``sibuna-<version>-1.aarch64.rpm`` مع "
"خدمة systemd؛ وتفعل ``sibuna-bin-<version>-1-x86_64.pkg.tar.zst`` ذلك على "
"Arch Linux."

